meta {
  name: centers
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Center-scoped APIs. Set env center_id. Auth: Bearer {{access_token}}.

  Associates: GET /centers/{{center_id}}/associates/, PATCH /centers/associates/{{associate_id}}/ (X-Center-ID). Role list: GET /centers/{{center_id}}/associate-roles/.
  v2/ subfolders: room-types, rooms, equipment-types, equipments, services.
  No DELETE on v2 — PATCH is_active=false.
}
